<div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">3. RISK &amp; DECISION</p><h3>Risiko setelah kontrol dan approval</h3></div></div>
<div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><table class="tprm-tier-table"><tbody><tr><td>100-200</td><td><strong>Due diligence: High</strong></td></tr><tr><td>201-350</td><td><strong>Due diligence: Medium</strong></td></tr><tr><td>351-500</td><td><strong>Due diligence: Low</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></article><article class="insight-panel"><h3>Aturan keputusan</h3><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Incomplete</strong><span>Data kosong tidak diberi label Low Risk.</span></li><li><strong>Critical control failure</strong><span>Approval diblokir sampai kontrol kritis diverifikasi lulus.</span></li><li><strong>Residual risk</strong><span>Gunakan rating setelah mitigasi; rating yang kosong tetap belum dinilai.</span></li><li><strong>Independent approval</strong><span>Approver berbeda dari reviewer; risiko tinggi perlu alasan penerimaan dan masa berlaku.</span></li></ul></article></div>
